                <p rendition="#flush">1. <hi rendition="#italic">Meeting of the Peace
                        Conference</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, it was <hi rendition="#italic">agreed</hi> to
                    continue the discussion of this question at the next meeting of the Foreign
                    Ministers.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">2. <hi rendition="#italic">Time of the Next Council
                        Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>The Foreign Ministers <hi rendition="#italic">decided</hi> to meet in private
                    session at 5 p.m. on the same day.</p>
